	, Tinkatink\, Piplup\, Zorua\, Pawniard\, Sobble\, Nickit\, Frigibax\, Gib
	le\, Deino\nPotential Shinies: Vulpix\, Ninetales\, Alolan Vulpix\, Alolan
	 Ninetales\, Grookey\, Thwackey\, Rillaboom\, Scorbunny\, Raboot\, Cindera
	ce\, Lechonk\, Oinkologne\, Oinkologne\, Tinkatink\, Tinkatuff\, Tinkaton\
	, Piplup\, Prinplup\, Empoleon\, Zorua\, Zoroark\, Pawniard\, Bisharp\, Ki
	ngambit\, Sobble\, Drizzile\, Inteleon\, Nickit\, Thievul\, Frigibax\, Arc
	tibax\, Baxcalibur\, Gible\, Gabite\, Garchomp\, Deino\, Zweilous\, Hydrei
	gon\nBonuses:\n  Increased Spawns\n  2x XP for catching Pokémon\n  2x Star
	dust for catching Pokémon\n  1/2 Hatch Distance when Eggs are placed into 
	Incubators during the event period\n  2x Catch Candy\n  2x Chance for Trai
	ners level 31 and up to receive Candy XL from catching Pokémon\n  3-hour I
	ncense**\n  1-hour Lures*\n  Up to two Special Trades can be made per day*
	\n  Trades made will require 50% less Stardust*\n* While most bonuses are 
	only active on December 12 and 13 from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time\,
	 these bonuses will be active from Saturday\, December 12\, at 9:00 a.m. t
	o Sunday\, December 13\, at 9:00 p.m. local time.\n** The three-hour Incen
	se bonus excludes Daily Adventure Incense.
